  "description": "Replacement of non-original PVC/aluminium, single-glazed windows with painted white timber sash windows to match existing.\nRemoval of timber garage doors and installation of a new sash window to match existing.\nRender to the lower ground floor façade.\nMinor structural alterations, including the removal of chimney breasts and the formation of new internal openings\n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;All new external facing and roofing materials in respect of all the works hereby approved (and any other incidental works carried out in this connection) shall match those of the existing building in respect of materials used, detailed execution and finished appearance including type, size, colour, bond, pointing, coursing, jointing, profile and texture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\nREASON: In the visual interest of the De Beauvoir Conservation Area.&lt;/p&gt;"
